<title>UK: LW Rentenbank sets 100 mln Swiss franc bond.</title>
<headline>LW Rentenbank sets 100 mln Swiss franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley, Zurich.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDWIRTSCHAFTLICHE RENTENBANK.</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN SFR   COUPON    *5.125     MATURITY    05.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE   FIX/REV FRN   ISS PRICE  101.50    PAY DATE    05.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.75	REOFFER    99.125    LISTING    EBS</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  2.375</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST FOUR YEARS THEN 10 PCT LESS TWO TIMES</p>
<p>	     6M LIBOR THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
